OL,3,GNEWSAContract agreed for asylum camp at
OL,4,Aformer RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetailed plans for a proposed migrant
OL,7,Fcamp are to be drawn up after the Home
OL,8,FOffice awarded a #3.4m contract.
OL,10,FConstruction giant Kier has been hired
OL,11,Fto design the camp at RAF Barnham, a
OL,12,Fformer nuclear weapons store, earmarked
OL,13,Ffor asylum seekers. The base is in
OL,14,FSuffolk but close to Thetford in
OL,15,FNorfolk.
OL,17,FThe revelation has raised fresh
OL,18,Fconcerns about the amount of public
OL,19,Fmoney being spent on the project before
OL,20,Fa final decision is made.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
